{
  "loreEntries": [
    {
      "loreEntryElementType": {
        "id": "01GR6AENPX6HQP8G16KNV7BNA2",
        "reference": "FLAVOR_TEXT",
        "subject": "Flavor Text"
      },
      "translations": {
        "de_DE": {
          "text": "Letztlich hatte er so ziemlich alle Weisheit dieser Welt gesammelt. Er füllte sie in eine Kalebasse und verschloss sie.",
          "locale": "de_DE"
        },
        "es_ES": {
          "text": "Al final, había hecho acopio de casi toda la sabiduría del mundo. La metió en una calabaza y le fabricó un corcho para taparla.",
          "locale": "es_ES"
        },
        "fr_FR": {
          "text": "Finalement, quand il eut rassemblé toute la sagesse qu'il ait pu trouver, il la mit dans une calebasse et la reboucha.",
          "locale": "fr_FR"
        },
        "it_IT": {
          "text": "Alla fine, era riuscito ad accumulare piuttosto bene tutta la saggezza disponibile. La mise in una zucca e ci mise un tappo.",
          "locale": "it_IT"
        },
        "en_US": {
          "text": "In the end, he had accumulated all the wisdom that was available. He put it in a gourd and made a stopper for it.",
          "locale": "en_US"
        }
      },
      "id": "01HNJH5TX165P5G0SFJS4WVCNW",
      "text": "In the end, he had accumulated all the wisdom that was available. He put it in a gourd and made a stopper for it."
    }
  ],
